FFmpeg 9 removed AVCodec::pix_fmts and AVCodec::supported_framerates
(deprecated since 7.1). Read both lists through
avcodec_get_supported_config() on libavcodec >= 61.13.100, keeping the old
field access for older FFmpeg.

Upstream: https://github.com/opencv/opencv/pull/29533 (merged into 4.x,
2026-08-11); the three commits squashed and rebased onto 4.12.0. Applies
to 4.13.0 and 5.0.0 with line offsets only.

